# PM Review Policy (Closed Beta)

## Standard Sprint (Autonomous)

Pipeline without PM gate:

```
Develop → QA → Build → Smoke → Production → Tag → Morning Report
```

- Preview deploy is **internal QA only** — do not wait for PM.
- **Morning Report must NOT include Preview URL.**
- Report **must include Production URL**: https://ai-startup-validation-tau.vercel.app

## PM checks Production only (~5 min)

Landing · Goal · Workflow · Workspace · Today · WOW (3-min journey)

PM role: **CPO** (experience PASS/FAIL + next Day Epic), not QA PM.

## Preview + PM approval required before Production

Only for: Product Pivot, navigation/UX overhaul, Auth, Billing, Real AI, DB schema, cost-bearing APIs, full design change.

Then: Preview URL in report → **Production BLOCKED** → await PM approval.

## Experience rule

> 사용자가 체감하지 못하는 기능은 만들지 않는다.

Epic order: Journey → Intelligence → Analytics → Performance → Real AI

Full policy: `docs/PM_REVIEW_POLICY.md`
